      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A patient with acute abdomen at 15th week of gestation underwent an emergency laparatomy. A ruptured rudimentary horn pregnancy was diagnosed, and the rudimentary part including the fetus and the accessories was resected. The mother survived without any complications."},
